                            </ul>
                            <div class="tab-content accordion" id="Div1">
                                
                                                                            
                                        <div id="rpttestimonials_ctl00_panel1" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="home-tab" tabindex="0" class="tab-pane fade show active accordion-item home-tab-pane1">

                                    <h2 class="accordion-header d-lg-none" id="headingOne">
                                        <p id="rpttestimonials_ctl00_p1" class="accordion-button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" aria-controls="collapseOne" aria-expanded="true" data-bs-target=".collapseOne1">Testimonials</p>
                                    </h2>
                                    <div id="rpttestimonials_ctl00_panel2" aria-labelledby="headingOne" data-bs-parent="#myTabContent" class="accordion-collapse collapse show  d-lg-block collapseOne1">
                                        <div class="accordion-body test-bg-grey">
                                            <div class="card-body p-0">
                                                <div class="testimonial_tab_body">
                                                    <div class="owl-carousel owl-theme testimonials-carousel cet">
                                                        
                                                                
                                                                
                                                                <div class="item">
                                                            <div class="row">
                                                                <div class="col-md-7">
                                                                    <div class="testimonial-detail">
                                                                        <blockquote>
                                                                            <p>
                                                                            
	“Forever I will be Thankful”………. It’s a privilege to be an alumnus of KLE, the years I spent at the institute were definitely the best of my life. I was blessed to have a good, caring, supportive and highly personable faculty, extremely supporting staff and diversified passionate friends. The exposure I received during my stay helped me to gain vital experience and placed me decisively on the path to success in my career.

                                                                            </p>
                                                                        </blockquote>
                                                                        <ul>
                                                                            <li>Dr. Subba Reddy B
                                                                            </li>
                                                                            <li>Principal<span>Recruiters</span>
                                                                            </li>
                                                                        </ul>
                                                                    </div>
                                                                </div>
                                                                <div class="col-md-5">
                                                                    <div class="testimonial-img">
                                                                        <img src="/uploads/TestimonialImage/24testi_Subba-Reddy-B.jpg" class="img-fluid" alt='24'>
                                                                    </div>
                                                                </div>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>

                                                            
                                                                
                                                                
                                                                <div class="item">
                                                            <div class="row">
                                                                <div class="col-md-7">
                                                                    <div class="testimonial-detail">
                                                                        <blockquote>
                                                                            <p>
                                                                            
	Ever grateful to the teachers at Dr. M. S. Sheshgiri College of Engineering and Technology, Belgaum for imbibing the fundamentals in learning—Discipline and hardwork. I belong to 1994 batch from the Electrical and Electronics Engineering, KLESCET-Belgaum. We were the last batch to write the yearly exam. This structure gave us ample time to cover the length and breadth of the subjects. Our Professors encouraged us to read and solve problems from the best of the books in Circuits, Machines, Controls etc. Laboratory work was given its due importance and the faculty always oversaw the experiments and guided us to achieve perfection. Even back then, we had the best of microprocessor kits, computers, HV lab, library facility etc. We were motivated to write competitive exams and pursue higher studies to enhance our technical skills. I owe to the college and my teachers for the academic position I enjoy today.

                                                                            </p>
                                                                        </blockquote>
                                                                        <ul>
                                                                            <li>Dr. Arunkumar D Mahindrakar
                                                                            </li>
                                                                            <li>Professor<span>Recruiters</span>
                                                                            </li>
                                                                        </ul>
                                                                    </div>
                                                                </div>
                                                                <div class="col-md-5">
                                                                    <div class="testimonial-img">
                                                                        <img src="/uploads/TestimonialImage/25testi_Arunkumar-D-Mahindrakar.jpg" class="img-fluid" alt='25'>
                                                                    </div>
                                                                </div>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>

                                                            
                                                                
                                                                
                                                                <div class="item">
                                                            <div class="row">
                                                                <div class="col-md-7">
                                                                    <div class="testimonial-detail">
                                                                        <blockquote>
                                                                            <p>
                                                                            
	K L E College of Engineering and Technology, now known as Dr. M. S. Sheshgiri College of Engineering and Technology, Belgaum is known for dedicated faculty members who always strive for the prosperity and growth of students. I feel proud about the Department of Electrical and Electronics where Prof. P. V. Kittur Sir, Prof. Arun Shiralkar Sir and other faculty members always support the students and mould the students into great personalities. I also thank Prof. R. P. Punagin who used to always encourage the students to achieve higher goals. I remember Prof. Padmanabhan, who was a great mentor to all the students. I appreciate and congratulate the Management under the leadership of Honorable Dr. Prabhakar Kore who has been a great inspiration to all the students and staff of the Institute

                                                                            </p>
                                                                        </blockquote>
                                                                        <ul>
                                                                            <li>Dr. Vishwanath P. Baligar
                                                                            </li>
                                                                            <li>Professor<span>Recruiters</span>
                                                                            </li>
                                                                        </ul>
                                                                    </div>
                                                                </div>
                                                                <div class="col-md-5">
                                                                    <div class="testimonial-img">
                                                                        <img src="/uploads/TestimonialImage/26testi_Vishwanath-P.-Baligar.jpg" class="img-fluid" alt='26'>
                                                                    </div>
                                                                </div>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>

                                                            
                                                                
                                                                
                                                                <div class="item">
                                                            <div class="row">
                                                                <div class="col-md-7">
                                                                    <div class="testimonial-detail">
                                                                        <blockquote>
                                                                            <p>
                                                                            
	K.L.E.S College of Engineering offers the right platform for students to excel academically while allowing the flexibility to pursue co-curricular activities at the highest competitive level. It therefore prepares students in a holistic manner for future successes in a Corporate or Entrepreneurial career. The Alumnus is a testimonial to what past students have achieved and continues to be trend with the present students. The students graduating from the college have a strong sense of giving back not only to the institution but the society at large, primarily due to foundation that was instilled at the time of professional education.

                                                                            </p>
                                                                        </blockquote>
                                                                        <ul>
                                                                            <li>Shri. Vijaykumar R
                                                                            </li>
                                                                            <li>Senior Consultant – IT Services Mindtree Ltd.<span>Recruiters</span>
                                                                            </li>
                                                                        </ul>
                                                                    </div>
                                                                </div>
                                                                <div class="col-md-5">
                                                                    <div class="testimonial-img">
                                                                        <img src="/uploads/TestimonialImage/27testi_Vijaykumar-R.jpg" class="img-fluid" alt='27'>
                                                                    </div>
                                                                </div>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>

                                                            
                                                                
                                                                
                                                                <div class="item">
                                                            <div class="row">
                                                                <div class="col-md-7">
                                                                    <div class="testimonial-detail">
                                                                        <blockquote>
                                                                            <p>
                                                                            
	It is the greatest privilege of my life to be an alumni of Dept. of Electrical Engineering of K.L.E.S. Institute of Engineering & Technology. I am indebted to my Alma Mater which sculpted me to reach to my present level as Head of Electrical & Automation Dept. for two cement plants which are part of world’s biggest cement group. I am humbled by the faculty, especially Prof.P.V.Kittur, who not only enriched us with quality education but also imparted values of life and discipline. I pray to the Almighty for healthy and long life of all our Professors.

                                                                            </p>
                                                                        </blockquote>
                                                                        <ul>
                                                                            <li>Shri. Tanuj Gupta
                                                                            </li>
                                                                            <li>Head (Elect. & Automation) Ambuja Cements Ltd<span>Recruiters</span>
                                                                            </li>
                                                                        </ul>
                                                                    </div>
                                                                </div>
                                                                <div class="col-md-5">
                                                                    <div class="testimonial-img">
                                                                        <img src="/uploads/TestimonialImage/28testi_Tanuj-Gupta.jpg" class="img-fluid" alt='28'>
                                                                    </div>
                                                                </div>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>

                                                            
                                                                
                                                                
                                                                <div class="item">
                                                            <div class="row">
                                                                <div class="col-md-7">
                                                                    <div class="testimonial-detail">
                                                                        <blockquote>
                                                                            <p>
                                                                            
	Proud alumni of KLE Dr. M.S. Sheshgiri college of Engineering & Technology – which is ranked as one of the top educational institutions in the country today. My journey at my alma mater is an unforgettable one, thanks to all the learned veteran professors. I learnt the ABCs of Engineering here. Graduation in E & E gave me a strong footing which enabled me to venture in post graduation in Computer Science and Engineering. Very delighted to see the progress of my alma mater in leaps and bounds and its unwavering dedication to push the boundaries even further in its quest to become the best.

                                                                            </p>
                                                                        </blockquote>
                                                                        <ul>
                                                                            <li>Dr. Rashmi R. Rachh
                                                                            </li>
                                                                            <li>B.E. : Electrical &Electronics from KLECET, Belagavi<span>Recruiters</span>
                                                                            </li>
                                                                        </ul>
                                                                    </div>
                                                                </div>
                                                                <div class="col-md-5">
                                                                    <div class="testimonial-img">
                                                                        <img src="/uploads/TestimonialImage/29testi_Rashmi-R.-Rachh.jpg" class="img-fluid" alt='29'>
                                                                    </div>
