                                                                        <blockquote>
                                                                            <p>
                                                                            
	I chose Electrical and Electronic course at KLE’s Dr.M.S Sheshgiri College of Engineering and Technology to help me get closer to my dreams. KLE’s Dr.M.S Sheshgiri College of Engineering and Technology is all about transformation. It not only has imparted the knowledge, but also reinforced in me the spirit of creative action and leadership. The faculty and peers were of great help in accentuating my learning experience through repeated confrontation by hard challenges and stern corrections. It helped me to discover that I am capable of so much more than I have given myself to believe. I feel proud of being a KLE’ian which has helped me shape up my thoughts ,my personality and my life.

                                                                            </p>
                                                                        </blockquote>
